OL,3,AUkrainian man arrested in Croatia over
OL,4,ANord Stream pipeline blasts
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Ukrainian man has been arrested in
OL,7,FCroatia on suspicion of taking part in
OL,8,Fthe bombing of the Nord Stream gas
OL,9,Fpipelines between Russia and Germany.
OL,11,FThe suspect is alleged by German
OL,12,Fauthorities to have been one of the
OL,13,Fscuba divers who planted explosives on
OL,14,Fthe pipelines in September 2022,
OL,15,Ffollowing Russia's full-scale invasion
OL,16,Fof Ukraine.
OL,18,FHe is the second man to be arrested
OL,19,Fover the plot, which has strained
OL,20,Frelations between Kyiv and Berlin - one
OL,21,Fof the key European backers for
OL,22,FUkraine's war effort.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
