OL,3,AUkrainian man arrested in Croatia over
OL,4,ANord Stream pipeline blasts
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The suspect participated in the
OL,7,Fnecessary dives" for the sabotage,
OL,8,FGerman prosecutors alleged, adding they
OL,9,Fwere pursuing the suspect's extradition
OL,10,Ffrom Croatia.
